ilms-list__by-date__film__rating\">15</span></a></h1><span class=\"films-list__by-date__film__season__link\">Part of   <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/1980s-the-lost-decade-of-japanese-cinema/\">1980s: The Lost Decade of Japanese Cinema</a></span>\n\n        \n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__synopsis synopsis\">\n                                  The tale of an eccentric band of culinary ronin who guide the widow of a noodle-shop owner on her quest for&hellip;\n                        </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__stats\">\n          Juzo Itami, Japan, 1985, 114m.       </div>\n\n      <!-- Date Panel /  Screening links -->\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__screeningtimes\">\n          <div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 04 Mar</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4683776.TcsSection_638\">20:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div>      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    \n  <div class=\"date-block\" data-date=\"2026-03-07\" data-intro=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-date__date\"><h2 class=\"films-list__by-date__date__title\">\n        <span>Saturday 7 March</span></h2></div>\n    <div class=\"film-block\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film\" data-intro=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__image__wrapper\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/unknown-pleasures/\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4747137.png\" class=\"films-list__by-date__film__thumb\" alt=\"\">      </a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__content\">\n      <h1 class=\"films-list__by-date__film__title\"><a\n          href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/unknown-pleasures/\">Unknown Pleasures          <span class=\"films-list__by-date__film__rating\">12</span></a></h1>\n\n        \n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__synopsis synopsis\">\n                                  Two unemployed Chinese teenagers have trouble resisting the temptations of the Western world. &hellip;\n                        </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__stats\">\n          Jia Zhangke, China, Japan, Korea, France, 2002, 112m.       </div>\n\n      <!-- Date Panel /  Screening links -->\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__screeningtimes\">\n          <div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 07 Mar</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4748629.TcsSection_3060731\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div>      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film\" >\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__image__wrapper\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/tetsuo-the-iron-man/\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4292359.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-date__film__thumb\" alt=\"\">      </a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-date__film__content\">\n      <h1 class=\"films-list__by-date__film__title\"><a\n          href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/tetsuo-the-iron-man/\">Tetsuo: The Iron Man          <span class=\"films-list__by-date__film__rating\">18</span></a></h1><span class=\"films-list__by-date__film__season__link\">Part of   <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/1980s-the-lost-decade-of-japanese-cinema/\">1980s: The Lost Decade of Japanese Cinem