></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,E\">E</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,F\">F</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,G\">G</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,H\">H</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,I\">I</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,J\">J</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,K\">K</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,L\">L</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,M\">M</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,N\">N</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,O\">O</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,P\">P</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,Q\">Q</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,R\">R</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,S\">S</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,T\">T</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,U\">U</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,V\">V</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,W\">W</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,X\">X</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,Y\">Y</a></li>\n         <li><a href=\"#by-title,Z\">Z</a></li>\n      </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"films-list__by-title films-list-block\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"films-list__by-title__inner\">\n      \n      <h2 class=\"films-list__by-title__title\" style=\"color: #215551;\">Browse all films A–Z </h2>\n      \n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-4\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/4-months-3-weeks-and-2-days/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4597797.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/4-months-3-weeks-and-2-days/\">4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Cristian Mungiu, 2007, Romania</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days was proposed by our members Joe Lovell-McNamee and Tania Sendroiu, who writes: 'Without revealing too much, it’s a film set in the late years of Communist Romania, but it feels all too relevant today. It’s quiet&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/4-months-3-weeks-and-2-days/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   free_members  members \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 14 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4597994.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-free_members\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-members\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 20 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4597999.TcsSection_971\">20:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-b\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ballad-of-narayama-2/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4292128.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ballad-of-narayama-2/\">The Ballad of Narayama <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Shohei Imamura, 1983, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Thursday 22 January will be introduced by Alastair Phillips (University of Warwick), and followed by a post film discussion group in the Atrium Bar.   Cinematic anthropologist extraordinaire Shohei Imamura won his first Palme d'Or at the 1983 Cannes&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ballad-of-narayama-2/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 22 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4292540.TcsSection_3060731\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 02 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSele