div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/fantasia/\">Fantasia <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em></em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                A magical journey through sound and vision, Disney's classic Fantasia consists of eight pieces of classical music, each set to its own piece of animation. More than 60 years after the film was made, each section has its own appeal, with moods ranging&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/fantasia/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 20 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790354.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 21 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790356.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 22 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790362.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/frozen/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4448670.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/frozen/\">Frozen <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Chris Buck and Jennifer Lee, 2013, United States</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The royal ice-drama phenomenon that spawned a franchise, it is no surprise it went on to become the fifth highest-grossing film of all time and the Oscar-winner for Best Animated Feature (it also won Golden Globe and Bafta for the same category).&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/frozen/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 14 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790310.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 15 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790321.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 17 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4790331.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-funeral/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4292038.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-funeral/\">The Funeral <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Juzo Itami, 1984, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                This screening will be introduced by Victor Fan (KCL), and will be followed by a post film discussion group in the Atrium Bar. It’s death, Japanese style, in the rollicking and wistful first feature from maverick writer-director Juzo Itami. In the wake&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-funeral/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 15 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4292524.TcsSection_3060731\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-g\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/gp-surgery-escatic-truths-present-sink-or-swim-1990-shorts/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4701830.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/gp-surgery-escatic-truths-present-sink-or-swim-1990-shorts/\">GP Surgery + Ecstatic Truths Present: Sink or Swim (1990) + Shorts <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em></em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Join GP Surgery and Ecstatic Truths in The Atrium Bar for a special event titled ‘In the Deep End’, a night of exploring water, memory, and the power of healing through reflection.  Our main film, which will be projected on 16mm film,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/gp-surgery-escatic-truths-present-sink-or-swim-1990-shorts/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 10 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4701604.TcsSection_3448696\">21:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-h\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/hamnet/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4662373.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/hamnet/\">Hamnet <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Chloé Zhao, 2025, UK, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                1580 England. Impoverished Latin tutor William Shakespeare meets free-spirited Agnes, and the pair, captivated by one another, strike up a torrid affair that leads to marriage and three children. Yet as Will pursues a budding theatre career in far-away London, Agnes anchors&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/hamnet/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 09 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4682709.TcsSection_3060731\">15:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4662396.TcsSection_971\">18:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4662394.TcsSection_638\">20:35</