ectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4292593.TcsSection_3060731\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 28 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4683610.TcsSection_3060731\">21:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-i\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-iron-giant/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/1162756.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-iron-giant/\">The Iron Giant <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Brad Bird, USA, 1999</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Bringing to life the much-loved story by British poet Ted Hughes, The Iron Giant takes place in a quiet American town in the 1960s. The tale begins when a young boy named Hogarth follows a trail of huge footprints leading from his house&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-iron-giant/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </