        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-l\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/living-large/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4483552.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/living-large/\">Living Large <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Kristina Dufková, Czech Republic, Slovakia, France, 2024</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Winner of many awards, including at Annecy Film Festival, the largest animation film festival in the world, Living Large is an honest exploration of puberty, first love and the difficult relationship with our bodies.The film’s gorgeous visual world is created using stop-motion puppet animation&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/living-large/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 17 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4483621.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-