, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Merry-Christmas--Mr--Lawrence-768x1163.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/merry-christmas-mr-lawrence/\">Merry Christmas, Mr. Lawrence <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Nagisa Oshima, 1983, Japan, New Zealand, UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Wednesday 21 January will be introduced by film journalist James Balmont. David Bowie stars in Nagisa Oshima's 1983 Palme d'Or-nominated portrait of resilience, pride, friendship and obsession among four very different men confined in the stifling jungle heat of&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/merry-christmas-mr-lawrence/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 09 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4292504.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 21 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4597940.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 28 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4683345.TcsSection_971\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-p\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/peter-hujars-day/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4638782.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/peter-hujars-day/\">Peter Hujar's Day <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ira Sachs, 2025, USA, Germany, UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                In 1974, famed photographer Peter Hujar describes the routines and rituals that define an artist's life, capturing a single day's activities from interactions with cultural icons of the day, including Allen Ginsberg, William S. Burroughs and Susan Sontag, and the texture and&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/peter-hujars-day/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class