n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ran-40th-anniversary/\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"1186\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Ran--40th-anniversary-.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Ran--40th-anniversary-.jpg 800w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Ran--40th-anniversary--202x300.jpg 202w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Ran--40th-anniversary--691x1024.jpg 691w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Ran--40th-anniversary--768x1139.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ran-40th-anniversary/\">Ran <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Akira Kurosawa, 1985, Japan, France</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                One of the most important and influential film makers in cinematic history, Akira Kurosawa directed 30 films in a career spanning 57 years. His final masterpiece, Ran, is a reimagining of Shakespeare’s King Lear set in feudal Japan. Ran tells the story of Lord&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ran-40th-anniversary/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 25 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4597953.TcsSection_638\">14:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 10 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4683419.TcsSection_638\">14:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 15 Feb</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4683523.TcsSection_638\">13:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/raya-and-the-last-dragon/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4448583.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/raya-and-the-last-dragon/\">Raya and The Last Dragon <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em> Don Hall and Carlos López Estrada, 2021, United States</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                A young warrior princess named Raya (voiced by Kelly Marie Tran) tries to reunite her kingdom by finding the last survivor of the race of dragons that used to protect her people. This computer-animated fantasy adventure is a visual feast inspired by&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/raya-and-the-last-dragon/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 24 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4483637.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 25 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4483639.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-s\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/1980s-japan-launch-tampopo/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4682098.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/1980s-japan-launch-tampopo/\">Sake, onigiri + Tampopo <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Juzo Itami, 1985, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Members are invited to join us on Saturday 17 January to help us serve up our new season of 1980s Japanese cinema: The Lost Decade. To celebrate in style, we'll be raising a glass of sake (or sparkling jasmine tea from Saicho)&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/1980s-japan-launch-tampopo/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro  members sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 17 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4699019.TcsSection_3067646\">16:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-members\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"Sake, onigiri + Tampopo\" data-datetime=\"Sat 17 Jan 16:00\" data-id=\"22954\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/sentimental-value/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/4566647.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/sentimental-value/\">Sentimental Value <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Joachim Trier, 2025, Norway, France, Germany, Denmark</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Following the success of global phenomenon The Worst Person in the World, Academy Award-nominee Joachim Trier reunites with BAFTA nominee Renate Reinsve for their universally acclaimed follow-up, Sentimental Value. Winner of the prestigious Cannes Grand Prix award, and featuring career-best performances from&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/sentimental-value/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 07 Jan</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_4598533.TcsSection_638\">17:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div><div 